# A worked example of companies working together (2026-09-30): the anvil pins the enemy with
# fire from cover so a neighbour can go in. Pair it with Hammer.
drill "Anvil"
about "Pins the enemy with fire from cover. When a neighbour charges it stands and covers him; when nobody is going in, it gives ground before a charge and comes back."
type Marksman
dials aggression 0.15 discipline 0.55 cohesion 0.35 cover 1.00 patience 0.60 nerve 0.70

sergeant:
  when neighbour charging                          -> hold; stand fast; find cover; fire at will
  when enemy charging and enemy within 30          -> fall back 20; set phase giving
  when phase is giving and enemy beyond 30 for 6s  -> advance; set phase screen
  when losing the exchange                         -> find cover; fire at will
  when no harm for 20s                             -> advance
  otherwise                                        -> form skirmish; find cover; fire at will

man:
  when neighbour charging and loaded and enemy within 70 -> fire
  when enemy charging and enemy within 20          -> fire; back 10
  when in cover and loaded and enemy within 70     -> fire
  when on high ground and loaded and enemy within 100 -> fire
  when not in cover                                -> take cover within 12
  when not in cover and not on high ground         -> take the high ground within 20
  otherwise                                        -> reload kneeling
